 * Does a static symbol name (YARA elf.symtab[i].name) match rRegExp? The names
 * are searched in the string tables linked (sh_link) from SHT_SYMTAB sections,
 * with the literal anchor sAnchor (see APKiD_reCount).
 * @returns {Boolean}
